# Impeccable: the design context is versioned (DESIGN.md, .impeccable/design.json, design-full.md,
# config.json, live/config.json, critique/ignore.md); what is per developer or per session stays local
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/live/*
!.impeccable/live/config.json
.impeccable/critique/*
!.impeccable/critique/ignore.md
